  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>&#8594;</mi><mi>R</mi></math> be defined as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is continuous on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math> equals :</p>"
  },
